Marker file: the presence of this file tells webpack.config.js to build
view.js as a native ES module (viewScriptModule) instead of an IIFE
(viewScript). Required for blocks that use the Interactivity API —
@wordpress/interactivity is module-only in WP 6.5+.

Do not add frontmatter or content logic; webpack only checks for the
file's existence, not its contents.
